WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.950
MV SearchCostumer AI. Paste your product's link, and the agent goes out to find your customers.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:16.400
Six automatic phases: it researches your product, maps the competition, builds the campaigns, finds companies, locates the decision makers and writes the emails.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:24.150
You pick the artificial intelligence model you want, from the most capable to the most economical, without touching anything technical.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:31.110
Your direct competitors, grouped by area down to the neighborhood, with their social profiles and public follower counts.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:37.480
The list arrives ranked by likelihood to close, with city and neighborhood, and you can filter it by area.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.580
For each company, the roles that decide, each with their language.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:48.040
Emails go out personalized, in the language of the recipient's country: Spanish, Portuguese or English.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:53.190
With an HTML version ready to send, with a banner and a link to your site.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:58.710
Plus the LinkedIn message and its invitation note, already under three hundred characters.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:07.510
And the analysis tab projects your business with your numbers: customers, sales, costs and net result up to twenty-four months, across three scenarios.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:15.330
And the digital marketing tab audits your real website and social profiles, compares you with your competitors and tells you what to fix first.

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:20.220
MV SearchCostumer AI. You show up and close.
